WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Paloma

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:02.600
What were you doing before you were a model?

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.100
In school, and I was working at T-shirt stores,

00:00:06.101 --> 00:00:09.980
and I was a waitress, and I was a tour manager for a musician

00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:12.360
I really just threw a lot of stuff at the wall

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.560
I've been modelling for four years

00:00:14.561 --> 00:00:17.300
I'm not a real model, but in my daytime,

00:00:17.301 --> 00:00:19.680
uh, I work as a strategist and consultant

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.940
Three years now, I was studying political science

00:00:22.941 --> 00:00:25.300
Two, three years, I was in art school

00:00:25.301 --> 00:00:26.593
I've been modelling for quite some time

00:00:26.594 --> 00:00:27.641
I'm an editor
